{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":80463,"seasonNumber":1},"checkedAt":1793468560261,"status":"ok","retryCount":0,"value":{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"year":2018,"episodeCount":24,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/naUmaL5ol6uPPPntd8L4GzyZX9b.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"1512139","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Episodio 1","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"In Kaiji: Ultimate Survivor, he tormented the downtrodden and enticed them into playing games where their lives were wagered against incredible cash prizes. But even a cold blooded monster can't spend every moment of the day trampling others. And in the real world, death games require planning, funding, oversight, and execution. This is the story of a lone man who struggles between his employer, the president, and his own employees, the men in black...Tonegawa Yukio: Middle Manager!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2018-07-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9KKb16WoHxsoCBOxowtWdiRAU2w.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9KKb16WoHxsoCBOxowtWdiRAU2w.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/80463/season/1/episode/1"},{"id":"1515059","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Episodio 2","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The second meeting of the death game production team is held, and Tonegawa needs to make up for the bad first impression he gave his workers. But between the confusing names of his team members and their bizarre objective, can the executive make sure the conversation heads in a productive direction?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2018-07-11","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2gd4ps0XIWhZLHovsAcA5tM2uwa.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2gd4ps0XIWhZLHovsAcA5tM2uwa.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/80463/season/1/episode/2"},{"id":"1524208","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Episodio 3","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"After a vicious act of betrayal in the last meeting, Tonegawa arranges weekend trip to an all-expenses paid villa to repair the cracks in his relationship with the team... but will it be enough?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2018-07-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kY8YUVZ9gkQ8fw6WlsziDOzTGw6.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kY8YUVZ9gkQ8fw6WlsziDOzTGw6.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/80463/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"1529679","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"After three unproductive meetings and a company trip, Tonegawa's team still has essentially nothing to show in terms of progress on their death game project. But after a bolt of inspiration, the middle manager himself thinks he might have the answer.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2018-07-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4Qjow9GsLquPlx4bngQZfq4OMvt.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4Qjow9GsLquPlx4bngQZfq4OMvt.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/80463/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"1534631","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"With the proposal for Restricted Rock Paper Scissors finished, Tonegawa just needs to turn it in to President Hyoudou... The tyrannical, temperamental, explosively volatile President Hyoudou.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2018-08-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rjJCnfoxcba98TJx4nkqX32kqQP.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rjJCnfoxcba98TJx4nkqX32kqQP.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/80463/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"1542677","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"As the deadline for the design of the Restricted Rock Paper Scissors cards approaches, Ebitani feels insecure because of Saemon's repeated successes. Tonegawa tries to mentor the wayward employee, but will he listen?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2018-08-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pcCj5QoihfblDLB4gTxJFpebx8B.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pcCj5QoihfblDLB4gTxJFpebx8B.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/80463/season/1/episode/6"},{"id":"1548564","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"As work begins to proceed on the first Restricted Rock Paper Scissors game, an unseen danger threatens to freeze the team's work to a standstill.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2018-08-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yyvc1XFYsLHlBUsrIZwQ1Gd7mjf.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yyvc1XFYsLHlBUsrIZwQ1Gd7mjf.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/80463/season/1/episode/7"},{"id":"1554937","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"After being fired from Teiai and causing Tonegawa's salary to be cut, Ebitani returns hoping to make amends.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2018-08-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hVGfqPi8z123ssuXCwJNF5QQwr5.jpg","stills":[{"type":