","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nNvTGHunLwPAoOuOVg1C0Bo5W14.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nNvTGHunLwPAoOuOVg1C0Bo5W14.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/80463/season/1/episode/14"},{"id":"1596166","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":15,"title":{"value":"Episodio 15","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"One of Ootsuki's regular excursions results in a clash of epic proportions, against an unexpected opponent...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2018-10-17","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/f5kpKEu40EfOlHv0AdFHFtoXwsu.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f5kpKEu40EfOlHv0AdFHFtoXwsu.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/80463/season/1/episode/15"},{"id":"1596170","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":16,"title":{"value":"Episodio 16","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Tonegawa is Teiai's number two man, but his position isn't exactly uncontested. When his rival, Kurosawa, steps into the picture even the battle hardened middle manager finds himself at a loss.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2018-10-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/q7XXrjPnH4YyTozawrHTXXtjURG.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/q7XXrjPnH4YyTozawrHTXXtjURG.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/80463/season/1/episode/16"},{"id":"1596171","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":17,"title":{"value":"Episodio 17","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The time has come for personnel changes at Teiai. When everything is said and done, who will be left on Team Tonegawa?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2018-10-31","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4ztQDcd2ZRmzHgu8IwBPuL83fJz.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4ztQDcd2ZRmzHgu8IwBPuL83fJz.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/80463/season/1/episode/17"},{"id":"1596173","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":18,"title":{"value":"Episodio 18","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Tonegawa's annual check-up leads to some lifestyle changes that are accompanied by unwanted attention, while Ootsuki finds something he never expected to encounter on one of his excursions.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2018-11-07","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2Xbl7DPelcFuEBAIcOvs475pOxj.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2Xbl7DPelcFuEBAIcOvs475pOxj.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/80463/season/1/episode/18"},{"id":"1618207","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":19,"title":{"value":"Episodio 19","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"With the recent transfers leaving him short-manned, Tonegawa welcomes three new employees to his team, and doesn't take long for two of them to start making waves within the company.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2018-11-14","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/AkT1drpnyZoxv2wVTEMvvBZLFMY.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AkT1drpnyZoxv2wVTEMvvBZLFMY.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/80463/season/1/episode/19"},{"id":"1624750","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":20,"title":{"value":"Episodio 20","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The man-eating Bog is a pachinko machine that makes a ludicrous amount of money for one of Teiai's underground casinos. The time has come for Tonegawa to collect the winnings, which means a showdown between him, the diabolical device, and the man who responsible for it: Ichijou!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"va